			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* chore: scaffold the mod and add the prd by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/2\n* feat: add wire, lamps, switches and control panels by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/5\n* feat: add sealing, controllers, circuits, charge, the lift and electronics by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/16\n* feat: redesign lamps and remove the block lamp by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/19\n* feat: add radio towers and live broadcasts by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/20\n* docs: add power sources to the prd by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/34\n* art: bring remaining blocks and items to 32x32 by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/22\n* docs: fix gaps in the power rules by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/36\n* feat: add power sources, the master switch and electric hum by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/37\n* fix: earn the advancement root from copper wire and open up the tab by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/39\n* feat: fill sources from a stack, fit screen text, add radio tone, tune fuel and unlock recipes by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/41\n* fix: close the gaps between the prd and the code by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/57\n* feat: weigh radio depth by toughness and add record pause and restart by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/59\n* feat: rework the lift and add the large lift by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/61\n* feat: cast lamp colour onto nearby blocks by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/63\n* docs: add the telephone network to the prd by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/65\n* chore: stop ci jobs after 20 minutes and fail fast on out of memory by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/83\n* feat: add telephones, the exchange and calls by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/84\n* feat: add telephone poles and overhead spans by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/85\n* feat: add telephone art, the bell box and the phone box by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/86\n* docs: add a radio mod icon, a night scene banner and a finished readme by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/91\n* fix: stop dry generators at once, count wide doors once, and keep tower masts in order by @grabartley in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/92\n\n## New Contributors\n* @grabartley made their first contribution in https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/pull/2\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/grabartley/minecraft-hardwired/commits/v0.2.0"
